{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧最大号的主句，视线首先被薄荷绿的“舒服地待在亲近里”和“暂时哪里也不去”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正和另一个人处于亲近之中，暂时不考虑两个人的未来，只想停留在当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、自在、放松、平静。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方大字补充了他其实很喜欢对方，也想知道对方是否有同样的感情，但没想好怎么开口，念头便淡了。小字还暗示平静之下存在一些阻力。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方主句较长，包含亲近、环境描写、身体感受和心理状态几个层次，需要从整句中筛选核心。\",\n    \"下方另一段字号也很大，带出喜欢却无法开口的另一层意思，会分走一部分主视线。\",\n    \"中间小字分成左右两组连续排列，需要在多条短句之间挑选信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8cc23c18-701d-4ddd-84e6-52d350d4b316", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021200167024Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:12:46.688252+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1aac2cd04335de12ffa9707cc898dc341801624f4a001a0c4b3ce7dd596aee72", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too